The MicroPython firmware for the ESP8266 is NOT included with VSA Simulator.
Its Espressif SDK may be used on ESP8266 chips only, so users who want to
run MicroPython on the simulated ESP8266 download ESP8266_GENERIC from
micropython.org themselves and add it with File > ESP8266 MicroPython
firmware.

